@id("app.main")
fn main() -> i64
{
    let mut x = 0;
    if x == 0 { x = 1; }
}
```

Statement `if` may omit `else` and branch values. The enclosing function
still needs its result: add `x` after the `if` as the block's tail expression.

<!-- expect: SPX-P106 -->
